From f4b5f1fd888072cf05cbf78434232ae4dfb4ae9e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: blame42 <346530647+git-blame-42@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 5 Nov 2026 17:29:46 -0300
Subject: [PATCH] feat: Event date window with minimum advance and maximum
 limit

notPastDate gains optional minDays/maxDays; Event requires starts_on between
today + 3 and today + 365 days on create and when the date changes. The form
shows the window and sets min/max on the date input.
